      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '1) Go to the gym everyday.


    2) Each exercise consumes Energy, whether
    performed correctly or not.


    3) Some exercises increase Strength, others
    increase Stamina.


    4) Complete the exercise minigame correctly in order
    to gain Strength or Stamina.


    5) Reach 100 Strength and 100 Stamina to complete
    your goal.


    6) The day ends when your Energy level is 0.


    7) Some exercises
    consume more energy than the others.


    8) Try to finish in as few days as
    possible to earn a better rank.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
